uses on the strongest signal. H1,H3,H9,H10 remain closed or rejected for clinically meaningful stronger dependency as originally registered. H7,H12 remain too imprecise. All claims are associations in the supplied dataset only; predictor labels are opaque, and biological interpretation, confounding, leakage, and generalizability remain uncertain.",
